            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "and the Regional Labor Relations Director of his/her intention to have a confirmatory retest. Upon request, the employee will arrange for the retest. The employee is responsible for all additional costs. The results of this retest will be forwarded to the Company as soon as the results are available for the Company's consideration.",
