        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "6. In the case of a \"positive\" test result, the employee shall be so advised by the Company's medical review officer or designee on a confidential basis, prior to the reporting of the results to the employer, and the employee shall have the right to discuss and explain the results, including the right to advise the employer's medical review officer or designee of any medication prescribed by his/her own physician, which may have affected the results of the test.",
            "block_bbox": [
